WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:06.480
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today I am&nbsp;
going to explain an episode called “Hi-so”&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:10.240
from a Thai mystery thriller anthology series&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:15.920
“Girl From Nowhere.” Spoilers&nbsp;
ahead! Watch out and take care!
&nbsp;

00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:24.480
In the opening scene, we are introduced to&nbsp;
a prestigious high school in Thailand. An&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:30.640
affiliate of the school is giving a tour to a new&nbsp;
student named Nanno. She shows her every classroom&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:30.640 --> 00:00:34.960
and tells Nanno the name of the parents who&nbsp;
donated for the rooms to be well-equipped.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:34.960 --> 00:00:40.400
It is clear that the school runs on donations from&nbsp;
the parents. The rich students are respected while&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:45.120
the poor ones are made fun of. Nanno asks if&nbsp;
she is allowed to pay to own one of the rooms&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:45.120 --> 00:00:50.160
in the school. The woman takes her words into&nbsp;
consideration and gives her an old classroom&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:50.160 --> 00:00:54.800
in turn for money. Nanno then changes the&nbsp;
classroom into her personal office. 
&nbsp;

00:00:55.440 --> 00:01:00.480
Somewhere else, the son of a millionaire&nbsp;
businessman, Dino, brings bags full of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:00.480 --> 00:01:06.720
gifts from the UK for his friends. He had gone to&nbsp;
visit his parents who live there. Alongside Dino,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:06.720 --> 00:01:12.480
To was also in the UK for a trip. His friends had&nbsp;
placed a bet on who would bring them more gifts,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:12.480 --> 00:01:17.360
and Dino wins. The friends unknowingly&nbsp;
compete against each other in terms of wealth.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:17.360 --> 00:01:21.920
Dino is the unsaid leader of the group&nbsp;
and the wealthiest one among them.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:21.920 --> 00:01:26.480
To asks him why he didn’t meet him when they were&nbsp;
in the same city, to which Dino replies that he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:26.480 --> 00:01:31.600
wanted to spend time with his family. 
To is infuriated that his friends like Dino&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:31.600 --> 00:01:36.320
better than him and is ashamed that he is&nbsp;
not as wealthy. It is evident that the group&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:36.320 --> 00:01:41.840
loves Dino just for his money. He is aware of&nbsp;
the fact but doesn’t mind them using him. 
&nbsp;

00:01:41.840 --> 00:01:46.240
The group finds out that a new student bought&nbsp;
an entire classroom for herself on her first&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:46.240 --> 00:01:52.160
day at school. Dino finally has a competitor which&nbsp;
he is not happy about. As they talk about Nanno,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:52.160 --> 00:01:56.800
she enters the classroom and affirms that&nbsp;
she did in fact buy a room in the school.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:56.800 --> 00:02:01.760
According to her, she is opening her own company&nbsp;
that will help the students get anything they want&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:01.760 --> 00:02:05.840
in turn for money. She hands them all her&nbsp;
business cards, claiming that her company’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:05.840 --> 00:02:10.960
motto is that money can buy everything.&nbsp;
Following that, the teacher walks in and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:10.960 --> 00:02:16.640
hands them all the results of the last test. 
Dino, as usual, gets the best grades out of them.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:16.640 --> 00:02:23.520
Meanwhile, Pop is mad because he scored only a&nbsp;
2.24 GPA when he had to cross 3.0 to get a new&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:23.520 --> 00:02:29.120
motorbike from his father. He complains about&nbsp;
life being unfair when Nanno offers to help him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:29.120 --> 00:02:36.160
through her company. She brings them to her office&nbsp;
and asks Pop for 15000 BATH for the service. Since it is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:36.160 --> 00:02:41.120
pretty cheap compared to the motorcycle he wants,&nbsp;
he decides to give her the money. Moreover, the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:41.120 --> 00:02:46.320
group wants to test if she is telling the truth.&nbsp;
After confirming that the money is paid in full,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:46.320 --> 00:02:52.400
Nanno asks for his test result and shreds it using&nbsp;
a paper shredder. The group is shocked but then,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:58.240
Nanno prints out a brand new paper with a better&nbsp;
score. It looks identical to the others so Pop’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:58.240 --> 00:03:03.040
parents wouldn’t notice that it is fake. He&nbsp;
thanks her, happy with the results. Nanno&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:03.040 --> 00:03:07.200
claims that she can do many other things&nbsp;
for them. When asked what kind of things,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:07.200 --> 00:03:12.960
she smiles and says anything. Starting that&nbsp;
day, her business flourishes quickly. A crowd&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:12.960 --> 00:03:17.680
of students lines up in front of her office&nbsp;
with money, asking her for several favors.
&nbsp;

00:03:17.680 --> 00:03:22.720
One day, a guy asks Nanno to teach his&nbsp;
ex-girlfriend a lesson for cheating on him.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:22.720 --> 00:03:28.640
That evening her new boyfriend is beaten to death&nbsp;
by some thugs. Similarly, another guy asks for a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:28.640 --> 00:03:34.720
girlfriend and gets one, thanks to her company.&nbsp;
One day after class, Nanno questions Dino why&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:34.720 --> 00:03:39.760
he hasn’t asked her for her services till now.&nbsp;
She thinks it is strange that he has no problems&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:39.760 --> 00:03:44.960
in his life. The others claim that he is filthy&nbsp;
rich, his parents are never home, and his grades&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:44.960 --> 00:03:50.240
are good. Since his life is basically perfect,&nbsp;
he doesn’t need her help. Pop even claims that if&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:50.240 --> 00:03:56.320
Nanno has a problem, she must come to Dino because&nbsp;
he has a solution to everything. Then, a girl&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:56.320 --> 00:04:01.760
named Whan mentions that she needs Dino’s help&nbsp;
to create a fake teacher’s letter to her parents.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:01.760 --> 00:04:06.800
She wants to go on an overnight trip outside&nbsp;
Thailand but doesn’t want her parents to know. 
&nbsp;

00:04:06.800 --> 00:04:11.760
The guys like the idea and join in on it.&nbsp;
Soon, they start to plan a trip to Japan.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:11.760 --> 00:04:16.320
When they ask Dino to join, he claims that&nbsp;
he is tired of taking so many trips abroad&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:16.320 --> 00:04:21.760
and just wants to be home for now. The others try&nbsp;
to convince him to join them but he doesn’t budge.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:21.760 --> 00:04:27.120
Nanno knows something about him is off. To find&nbsp;
out, she suggests they go to Dino’s house for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:27.120 --> 00:04:32.320
dinner. Since it is a massive villa that has a&nbsp;
swimming pool, a home theater, a snooker room,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:32.320 --> 00:04:37.680
a golf room, and many other facilities, the group&nbsp;
is sure to enjoy the stay much more than if they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:37.680 --> 00:04:42.720
travel abroad. However, Dino doesn’t want them&nbsp;
in his house, afraid that they will get drunk and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:42.720 --> 00:04:47.920
break expensive things in it. Pop promises&nbsp;
to take responsibility for all the damages&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:47.920 --> 00:04:53.200
and urges him to invite them for only a night.
When he still doesn’t agree, they get irritated&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:53.200 --> 00:04:58.320
and ask him if he considers them his friends. Dino&nbsp;
doesn’t want them to be upset and agrees to let&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:58.320 --> 00:05:03.680
them stay for a single night. After school ends,&nbsp;
he gets inside his car and tells the driver the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:03.680 --> 00:05:08.800
address to his house. When he reaches there, it&nbsp;
is revealed that Dino’s parents are small business&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:08.800 --> 00:05:13.760
owners who work hard to send him to a prestigious&nbsp;
school. When he first came into the school,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:13.760 --> 00:05:19.440
he saw how only the rich kids had friends and&nbsp;
lied to them about being wealthy. With time, he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:19.440 --> 00:05:24.720
had to keep up with the lie by renting cars to the&nbsp;
school and buying them food from his fake foreign&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:24.720 --> 00:05:30.560
trips. This is the reason why he didn’t meet&nbsp;
To during his last “trip” to the UK. Similarly,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:30.560 --> 00:05:35.680
he didn’t want to invite his friends to his&nbsp;
extravagant villa, because he doesn’t have one.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:35.680 --> 00:05:41.120
Dino’s parents are normal people who want nothing&nbsp;
but his happiness. They are unaware of their son’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:41.120 --> 00:05:46.720
shenanigans and think that his generous friends&nbsp;
drop him home in their fancy cars every day.
&nbsp;

00:05:46.720 --> 00:05:50.720
They never let Dino help them in household&nbsp;
work, saying that he should focus on his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:50.720 --> 00:05:56.320
studies instead. That day, Dino is tense because&nbsp;
if he doesn’t bring his friends to a massive villa&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:56.320 --> 00:06:01.040
the next day, they will know that he has been&nbsp;
lying to them for several years. After coming&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:01.040 --> 00:06:06.640
this far with the lies, he cannot step back. He&nbsp;
gets a text from Nanno in the group chat asking&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:06.640 --> 00:06:11.440
him at what time they should come to his house.&nbsp;
Dino is thinking of a way to avoid the topic but&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:11.440 --> 00:06:15.840
his friends start to talk about what they are&nbsp;
going to wear to the dinner. As the conversation&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:15.840 --> 00:06:21.040
proceeds, he cannot say no to them. 
His only way is to ask Nanno for help.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:21.040 --> 00:06:25.440
He calls her and tells her that he wants a&nbsp;
house for the next day. When asked why he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:25.440 --> 00:06:30.000
cannot take them to his original house, he still&nbsp;
insists that he doesn’t want them to break the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:36.000
expensive decorations. Nanno promises to keep it&nbsp;
a secret and agrees to help him with his problem.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:40.400
However, she charges two hundred&nbsp;
thousand baht for the fake mansion. 
&nbsp;

00:06:40.400 --> 00:06:45.440
Dino doesn’t have that much money to waste for a&nbsp;
single night but he hopes to manage it. When his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:45.440 --> 00:06:50.480
parents are distracted packing boxes for their&nbsp;
business, he steals his father’s purse. As he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:50.480 --> 00:06:54.800
is about to bring the card out, he overhears&nbsp;
his parents talking about loan sharks who have&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:54.800 --> 00:06:59.840
been bothering them every day. If they do not pay&nbsp;
them two hundred thousand baht by the next week,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:59.840 --> 00:07:04.000
they have threatened to kill them. The couple&nbsp;
is relieved because they have earned enough&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:04.000 --> 00:07:09.360
this month to pay off the loans. Dino puts the&nbsp;
card back after listening to their conversation.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:14.320
But then, a vision of his friends calling him a&nbsp;
liar and a cheat makes him take it out again. 
&nbsp;

00:07:19.760 --> 00:07:25.120
When his parents fall asleep, he sneaks out of&nbsp;
the house and withdraws money from the ATM. On&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:25.120 --> 00:07:29.440
returning home, he encounters his father&nbsp;
and is almost caught. The next morning,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:29.440 --> 00:07:34.320
Dino wakes up to his parents on a phone call with&nbsp;
the bank, complaining about the theft. When the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:34.320 --> 00:07:39.200
phone operator suggests someone from the family&nbsp;
must have taken it out, Dino’s father refuses to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:39.200 --> 00:07:44.320
believe it. Dino simply walks out of the house&nbsp;
and meets Nanno in front of his mansion for the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:44.320 --> 00:07:49.360
day. When asked if he likes it, he comments&nbsp;
that it is a bit smaller than his house. 
&nbsp;

00:07:49.360 --> 00:07:53.920
Later, the entire group arrives at the house&nbsp;
for dinner. Dino proudly sits on the sofa,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:53.920 --> 00:07:59.360
pretending like the expensive cigar and the&nbsp;
in-house golf course is normal to him. Then,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:59.360 --> 00:08:04.080
Nanno suggests they drink whiskey. She is&nbsp;
set on calling the maids to serve them,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:04.080 --> 00:08:07.920
almost as if she has planned something.&nbsp;
When the housemaids arrive in the lobby,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:07.920 --> 00:08:13.280
Dino is shocked to see that it is his parents.
They have taken the job to earn more money to pay&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:13.280 --> 00:08:18.480
off the loan. They recognize their son but do&nbsp;
not call him out in front of his friends. Dino&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:18.480 --> 00:08:23.440
can hardly say anything when Nanno suggests they&nbsp;
look at his parents’ pictures on the internet.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:23.440 --> 00:08:28.080
On finding them, she also comments that he&nbsp;
resembles the house servants, more than he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:28.080 --> 00:08:33.360
resembles his parents. Dino’s mother helps him,&nbsp;
claiming that he looks like his grandfather. 
&nbsp;

00:08:33.360 --> 00:08:38.240
Following that, they go to the dining room and&nbsp;
are served a full-course restaurant-style meal.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:38.240 --> 00:08:43.680
When they drink the whiskey, they realize that it&nbsp;
is actually fruit juice. Pop lashes out at Dino’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:43.680 --> 00:08:48.320
father, calling him an idiot. The man apologizes&nbsp;
and says that they shouldn’t be drinking at&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:48.320 --> 00:08:54.400
their age. This makes Pop even more furious. He&nbsp;
emphasizes that Dino’s father is just a servant,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:54.400 --> 00:08:59.520
asking him to act like one. After being insulted,&nbsp;
the man simply serves them the drink.
&nbsp;

00:08:59.520 --> 00:09:04.880
To stir the awkwardness, Nanno suggests they&nbsp;
smoke weed as well. Dino tries to stop them,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:04.880 --> 00:09:09.200
saying that his parents might find out&nbsp;
but the group doesn’t listen. To fit in,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:09.200 --> 00:09:14.960
he also smokes while his parents watch him in&nbsp;
disappointment. Moments later, Pop asks for wine&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:14.960 --> 00:09:20.240
but Dino’s father refuses to serve it since they&nbsp;
have already had too much to drink. Pop threatens&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:20.240 --> 00:09:25.920
to get him fired and insults him yet again. Scared&nbsp;
of him, Dino’s mother serves them the wine even&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:25.920 --> 00:09:32.000
when the father disagrees. She accidentally drops&nbsp;
it on Whan who accuses her of doing it on purpose.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:37.920
Pop gets up from his seat, ready to fight them but&nbsp;
Dino stops him. He calms everyone down and asks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:37.920 --> 00:09:43.040
his friends to go to another room. For a minute,&nbsp;
he is left alone with his parents but he walks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:43.040 --> 00:09:47.920
away when his mother tries to talk to him. 
Following that, the group goes to a study room&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:47.920 --> 00:09:52.400
while complaining about the rude servants. They&nbsp;
want to do something fun to lighten the mood&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:52.400 --> 00:09:58.160
when Nanno shows them a revolver she found on&nbsp;
a shelf. Pop loads a single bullet and bets two&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:58.160 --> 00:10:03.680
hundred thousand baht on the person who gets shot.&nbsp;
The group joins in and bets two hundred thousand&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:03.680 --> 00:10:08.880
baht each. The person to get shot in the arm&nbsp;
will receive more than one million baht, so Dino&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:08.880 --> 00:10:14.720
doesn’t want to give up the chance. Pop goes first&nbsp;
but isn’t shot, similarly, three of them press&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:14.720 --> 00:10:19.760
the trigger with the gun to their arm, but they do&nbsp;
not get shot as well. When it is Nanno’s turn, she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:19.760 --> 00:10:26.880
points to her head but doesn’t get shot either.&nbsp;
At last, it is Dino’s turn. He is about to shoot&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:26.880 --> 00:10:32.000
himself when his father stops him. He yells at&nbsp;
the kids to be more responsible with their lives&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:32.000 --> 00:10:38.240
because their parents love them. An enraged Pop&nbsp;
hits him with a golf club and knocks him out. 
&nbsp;

00:10:38.240 --> 00:10:42.800
Before the group can react, Dino’s mother&nbsp;
interferes and starts to scold them.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:42.800 --> 00:10:48.080
Pop hits her with the back of the revolver and&nbsp;
knocks her out as well. Dino freezes in shock but&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:48.080 --> 00:10:53.600
he still doesn’t do anything to help his parents.&nbsp;
Nanno starts to laugh maniacally while the others&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:53.600 --> 00:10:58.640
look at the maids in horror. In the following&nbsp;
scene, Dino walks to his house to see that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:58.640 --> 00:11:03.680
his parents are having dinner. Their faces are&nbsp;
covered in injuries that were inflicted by Pop.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:03.680 --> 00:11:09.280
They do not talk about the events of the day and&nbsp;
call him to have dinner. A flashback shows us&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:09.280 --> 00:11:13.680
that after coming back to consciousness, they&nbsp;
were given thirty-five hundred thousand baht&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:13.680 --> 00:11:18.800
to keep their mouths shut. Following that,&nbsp;
we see the family having dinner peacefully.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:18.800 --> 00:11:22.437
The camera pans towards the bag of money they&nbsp;
received earlier. 

00:11:22.897 --> 00:11:24.800
Subscribe for more videos like this,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:24.800 --> 00:11:27.840
turn on the notification, and leave a like to&nbsp;
help the channel out. Thanks for watching.

